=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Tsetseroon} to begin this quest.
** There is no cutscene to start this quest.
* Head to {z:Wajaom Woodlands} (D-9) and zone into {z:Aydeewa Subterrane}.
** Reach (G-10) on map 3 for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Tsetseroon} to offically begin this quest.
* Trade {n:Tsetseroon} a {i:Tin Ore|Tin Ore|641} and a {i:Cobalt Jellyfish|Cobalt Jellyfish|4443}. He will give you a {k:Pot of Tsetseroon's stew}.
* Return to {z:Aydeewa Subterrane} (G-10 Map 3) and check the **???** at the top of the damaged stairwell for a cutscene.
** Choose to look into Wawaroon's bag for a {k:Map of Aydeewa Subterrane}.
* Return to {n:Tsetseroon} for an {i:Imperial Bronze Piece|Imperial Bronze Piece|2184} and to complete the quest.

>**{c=red:Note}**:
* If you chose not to look into Wawaroon's bag, you will receive the {k:Map of Aydeewa Subterrane} when you return to {n:Tsetseroon} instead; you will not get an {i:Imperial Bronze Piece|Imperial Bronze Piece|2184}.

